    test: "A larger, prospective phase 2 basket trial of a FAP-targeted radioligand (such as 177Lu-FAPI-2286 or 177Lu-FAPI-XT) restricted to FAP-PET-selected sarcoma patients, ideally enriched for the subtypes (solitary fibrous tumour, myofibroblastic sarcoma) that showed the most disease control in the dose-escalation series, roughly 40-60 patients, with RECIST objective response rate and progression-free survival as endpoints, to resolve the conflicting signal from the existing small case series.",
